            <profile id="8f89-a736-bdde-178a" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="af20-e256-4a51-93aa" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, light armour and shield. May have throwing spear (+2 pts), javelins (+2 pts). May exchange shield for additional hand weapons (+3 pts) or double-handed axe (+3 pts). May be mounted on a horse (+8 pts). Army General. 0-1 Army General (Konnungr or Jarl). (Shieldwall p.12)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
