              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Javelins. May have buckler (+1 pt). Light Infantry. Hiberno-Norse: may exchange javelins and bucklers for slings at no additional cost. Orkneyinga: may exchange javelins for thrusting spears at no additional cost. (Shieldwall p.14)</characteristic>
